# SfxLab bench v1: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>]
# gravitic v1 — a first draft on the pyretic v3 plan (one bed, chord-tone voices lifted out of the sub, a cloud that grows
# with the machine), voiced for weight: every recording here is 85-97 % sub-bass, so the voices are partials lifted two or
# three octaves with their residual off (the rumble stays in the bed), the bed and a C1 sub carry the mass, and the sub grows
# with the number of motions (stack): the more you build, the heavier it gets. Filters move with the orb, reverb is wide.
bench 1
root 65.4064
layer bed gravitic/gravitic_synth_00004 7 0.0000 3001 level=0.35000 attack=0.60000 release=1.00000 pitch=0.15000 cutoff=0.70000 echo=0.00000 reverb=0.25000 drive=0.00000 loop=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=1.00000 lfo_rate=0.35000 lfo>cut=0.00000 keyed=1 file=gravitic/gravitic_synth_00004.ogg
layer halo gravitic/gravitic_synth_00004 7 0.0000 3014 level=0.00000 attack=0.80000 release=1.20000 pitch=12.15000 cutoff=0.80000 reverb=0.60000 loop=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=0.00000 keyed=1 file=gravitic/gravitic_synth_00004.ogg
layer sub gravitic/gravitic_synth_00006 7 0.0000 3002 level=0.00000 attack=1.20000 release=1.50000 pitch=-4.85000 cutoff=0.60000 reverb=0.00000 loop=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=0.60000 keyed=1 file=gravitic/gravitic_synth_00006.ogg
layer root gravitic/gravitic_wub_00001 7 0.0000 3003 level=0.00000 attack=0.40000 release=0.80000 pitch=22.20000 cutoff=0.80000 reverb=0.60000 loop=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=0.00000 keyed=1 file=gravitic/gravitic_wub_00001.ogg phaser=1.00000
layer third gravitic/gravitic_synth_00005 7 0.0000 3004 level=0.00000 attack=0.50000 release=0.90000 pitch=15.70000 cutoff=0.70000 reverb=0.60000 loop=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=0.00000 keyed=1 file=gravitic/gravitic_synth_00005.ogg
layer fifth gravitic/gravitic_synth_00003 7 0.0000 3005 level=0.00000 attack=0.50000 release=0.90000 pitch=19.50000 cutoff=0.70000 reverb=0.65000 loop=1.00000 sines=1.00000 residual=0.00000 keyed=1 file=gravitic/gravitic_synth_00003.ogg phaser=1.00000
layer seventh tones 1 0.0000 3006 level=0.00000 attack=0.60000 release=1.00000 pitch=12.68800 cutoff=0.50000 reverb=0.70000 timbre=1.00000 bank=0.50000 tilt=-0.60000 keyed=1
layer cloud cloud 0 0.0000 3007 level=0.00000 attack=1.00000 release=1.50000 pitch=3.00000 cutoff=0.60000 reverb=0.75000 voices=5.00000 gather=0.50000 drift=0.20000 timbre=0.20000 chord=5.00000 sub=0.00000 keyed=1
layer tide gravitic/gravitic_slow_rising-falling_loop_00001 5 0.0000 3008 level=0.00000 attack=0.80000 release=1.20000 pitch=0.00000 cutoff=0.60000 loop=1.00000 keyed=2 file=gravitic/gravitic_slow_rising-falling_loop_00001.ogg
layer impact gravitic/gravitic_impact_00001 5 8.0000 3009 level=0.50000 attack=0.00500 release=0.10000 pitch=0.00000 cutoff=0.80000 keyed=2 on=lock file=gravitic/gravitic_impact_00001.ogg
layer riser gravitic/gravitic_riser_00002 5 8.0000 3010 level=0.30000 attack=0.02000 release=0.10000 pitch=0.00000 cutoff=0.80000 keyed=2 on=accept file=gravitic/gravitic_riser_00002.ogg
layer downer gravitic/gravitic_downer_00002 5 8.0000 3011 level=0.40000 attack=0.02000 release=0.10000 pitch=0.00000 cutoff=0.80000 keyed=2 on=unlock file=gravitic/gravitic_downer_00002.ogg
range bed level 0.15 0.35 rests at 0.35, back to 0.22 with stir, and lower still as the machine fills (stack)
range bed lfo>cut 0 0.6 the slow filter wobble (0.35 Hz), deeper with the orb's speed
range sub level 0 0.25 synth_00006 at C1: the weight, growing with the number of motions
range root level 0 0.32 the root: wub_00001 lifted to C4, sines only (it throbs: a wub)
range halo level 0 0.14 the bed's own partials an octave up: the mids that let the family carry on small speakers, in with stir
range third level 0 0.35 the third: synth_00005 lifted to E3, sines only
range fifth level 0 0.3 the fifth: synth_00003 lifted to G3, sines only
range seventh level 0 0.12 the seventh: a dark tone at Bb3
range cloud level 0 0.3 the chord, growing with the number of motions; spells raise it and pick the chord
range cloud gather 0.5 1 a soft cluster while searching, the chord once every ratio is an integer
range tide level 0 0.35 the near-miss flicker: the slow rising-falling loop, low-passed
bind stir bed level 0.35 0.22
bind stir halo level 0 0.14
bind stack bed level 0 -0.08 rel
bind stack sub level 0 0.25
bind orb.accel sub drive 0 0.08
bind orb.speed bed lfo>cut 0 0.6
bind tone.root root level 0 0.32
bind tone.third third level 0 0.35
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.3
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.12
bind tension seventh bank 0.2 0.8
bind stack cloud level 0 0.3
bind coherence cloud gather 0.5 1
bind radiance cloud reverb 0.5 0.9
bind fit root shimmer 0.3 0
bind fit third shimmer 0.3 0
bind orb.radius root cutoff 0.4 0.9
bind orb.radius halo cutoff 0.3 0.9
bind orb.radius third cutoff 0.35 0.9
bind orb.radius fifth cutoff 0.35 0.9
bind orb.radius seventh cutoff 0.2 0.7
bind orb.curl cloud drift 0.1 0.45
bind orb.curl fifth ph_pos 0 1
bind orb.speed root ph_pos 0 1
bind score tide level 0 0.35
note gravitic v1 (draft, 2026-09-26). Same plan as pyretic v3: bed at C2 (synth_00004), chord-tone voices at C4 / E3 / G3 / Bb3 brought in
note by tone.*, the cloud by stack and coherence. What is gravity here: a C1 sub that grows with stack (the more motions, the more mass),
note a slow filter wobble on the bed that deepens with the orb's speed, every voice's low-pass opened by the orb's radius, wide reverbs.
note One-shots: impact on lock, riser on accept, downer on unlock. The voices' residuals are off because these recordings are all sub.
note Names and recipes below are placeholders to rename; the recipes were checked buildable and non-degenerate.
